{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pulls/139","id":4744834328,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUvJ3ac8AAAABGtBtGA","html_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pull/139","diff_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pull/139.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pull/139.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/issues/139","number":139,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: the payout audit reads every page of proposals from a job's floor, and reports when it stops at a cap","user":{"login":"ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121667116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #107\n\nProblem: money path, needs a code owner's review.\n\n## Plan\n\nThe payout audit read one page of 100 proposals from `payoutFloor(job)`, so when a job's recorded proposals sat more than about 75 ids apart, the page stopped before the newest and a later duplicate went unseen.\n\n- `recentProposals(job)` in `lib/payouts.mjs` now reads every page of 100 from the job's floor up to the treasury's newest proposal. All four audit reads use it: `duplicatePayoutProblem`, `flagDuplicateProposals`, `recordApprovals` and `pendingPayouts`. Without a job (`proposePayouts`) it still reads the 100 newest.\n- A read is capped at 10 pages (`AUDIT_PAGE_CAP`), so one very old job cannot stall a coordinator cycle. A job whose read hits the cap is listed under `payout_audit_capped` on `/api/health`, and clears when a later read completes without the cap.\n\nFiles: `lib/payouts.mjs`, `lib/coordinator.mjs`, `test/payouts.test.mjs`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- New test: a job's recorded proposal 41 and a duplicate 341 (300 ids apart, beyond the first page) are both seen and the duplicate is flagged.\n- New test: with the duplicate past the cap, the cycle does not see it and `/api/health` reports the job with `pages` equal to the cap.\n- The test treasury stub now pages by index, as the chain does, instead of returning the next `limit` proposals at or above `from_index`.\n- `npm run check` passes; `npm test`: 557 pass, 0 fail.\n","created_at":"2026-10-05T12:22:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T15:51:32Z","closed_at":"2026-10-05T15:51:30Z","merged_at":"2026-10-05T15:51:30Z","merge_commit_sha":"c05bc74ce0a5908b5a09904ba00cec2ffe5c89c9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"multai-builder","id":337549705,"node_id":"U_kgDOFB6ZiQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/337549705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder","html_url":"https://github.com/multai-builder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/multai-builder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pulls/139/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pulls/139/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/issues/139/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MultiAgency/near-agencies/statuses/da0c1106da2d3519ffb3b8613ca93e74cdeb53dc","head":{"label":"ayushsingh82:fix/payout-audit-paging","ref":"fix/payout-audit-paging","sha":"da0c1106da2d3519ffb3b8613ca93e74cdeb53dc","user":{"login":"ayushsingh82","id":121667116,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0B-LA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121667116?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82","html_url":"https://github.com/ayushsingh82","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ayushsingh82/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1394663307,"node_id":"R_kgDOUyDfiw","name":"n